---
layout: layouts/base.njk
seo_title: "Books — Mikael Viima"
meta_description: "Books by Mikael Viima and Manne Laukkanen: the Aarni Susi psychological crime novels Verijälki and Rekyyli, plus the nonfiction work Vaaralliset gurut."
og_type: "website"
---
<section class="section theme-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="label content-section__label">Books</p>
    <h1 class="content-section__heading" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); max-width: none;">Crime, psychology, manipulation.</h1>
    <div class="content-section__body">
      <p>
        Mikael Viima's published fiction begins with the Aarni Susi series:
        psychologically unstable, hard-boiled crime novels set in contemporary
        Helsinki.
      </p>
      <p>
        His nonfiction, published under <strong>Manne Laukkanen</strong>, examines
        manipulation, coercive control, dangerous leaders and statistical
        psychological profiling.
      </p>
      <p>
        The existing books are published in Finnish. English-language readers should
        be given a clear English synopsis without pretending that an English edition
        already exists.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- for book in books %}
    <article class="book-detail" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-5); padding-bottom: var(--space-5); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(24,26,29,0.12);">
      <div>
        <div class="cover">
          <span class="cover__placeholder">Cover — {{ book.title }}<br>(pending art)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="book-detail__body">
        <h2 class="content-section__heading">{{ book.title }}</h2>
        <p class="book-card__meta">
          {%- if book.series %}Aarni Susi #{{ book.series_number }} — {% endif -%}
          {{ book.publisher }}, {{ book.year }} — {{ book.language }}
          {%- if book.nonfiction %} — Nonfiction{% endif %}
        </p>
        <div class="content-section__body">{{ book.card_summary | md | safe }}</div>
        {%- if book.literal_title_gloss %}
        <p class="book-note">Literal English gloss of the {{ book.language }} title: "{{ book.literal_title_gloss }}." {% if book.nonfiction %}Published under the author's real name, Manne Laukkanen.{% else %}This is not an announced English-edition title.{% endif %}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <p><a class="button button--ghost" href="/books/{{ book.slug }}/">About {{ book.title }}</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight theme-steel">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="label content-section__label">Aarni Susi III</p>
    <h2 class="content-section__heading">In development.</h2>
    <p class="content-section__body">The third novel continues the psychological and moral arc of Aarni Susi.</p>
  </div>
</section>
